          <tr><td style="padding:10px 0;color:#101820;font-size:16px;font-weight:700;">Texas A&amp;M 41, The Citadel 0</td><td align="right" style="padding:10px 0;color:#5B6472;font-size:14px;">Aggies get well</td></tr>
